Error [jet.InvalidEmbedPath]: `embed_bytes` path can't use `..`
  --> tests/ui/comptime_embed_bytes_dotdot.jet:1:15
    |
  1 | D: comptime { embed_bytes("../secret.bin") }
    |               ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Comptime inputs are named from this file's own directory down, so a build can audit them; `..` is refused even when it names a file inside the package
 Fix: Drop the `..` and use a path under this file's directory
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0957
